## Handoff notes of earlier planners
Each planning call starts a new planner with no memory of the calls before it. Every call
that scheduled a plan left a handoff file: its reasoning, the workstreams it scheduled, what it
expected of each, what it meant to do next on each outcome, and its open doubts.
